---
description: Keep all project work on main
alwaysApply: true
---

The owner of this repository asked for this explicitly, and it still applies after a context reset:

- Do all work on the `main` branch. Do not create a feature branch.
- Commit and push to `origin/main` after each update so they can pull `main` and test.
- Do not open pull requests.
- Do not create walkthrough videos, screen recordings, or demo screenshots unless they ask for them.
